text:
Q: how to show database results in a specific column view in codeigniter A: <p>You just need to loop your html list element for all results in $data['portfolio'] you sent to view.
The code can simply be:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;?php foreach($portfolio as $list){ ?&gt; **your html code** &lt;?php } ?&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>and for showing titles and folio data you can use $list as:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;?php echo $list['smalltitle'] ;?&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>**UPDATE:</p>

<p>Please Follow this syntax.</p>

<pre><code>&lt;?php foreach($portfolio as $list){ ?&gt;

    &lt;li class="column"&gt;

    &lt;a href="#"&gt;
    &lt;div&gt;
      &lt;img src="&lt;?php echo $list-&gt;imgsrc; ?&gt;" class="w100" /&gt; 
      &lt;span class="copy border-box pr20 pl20 animate"&gt;
          &lt;i class="pointer animate"&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
             &lt;small class="title orange block pt20 pb10 animate"&gt;
                  &lt;?php echo $list-&gt;smalltitle;?&gt;
             &lt;/small&gt;
      &lt;span class="show-on-desktop"&gt;&lt;?php echo $list-&gt;tagline; ?&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;span class="show-on-mobile"&gt;&lt;?php echo $list-&gt;tagline; ?&gt;&lt;/span&gt;

      &lt;span class="cta"&gt;
                &lt;!-- &lt;i class="fa fa-arrow-circle-o-right fa-lg"&gt;&lt;/i&gt; --&gt;
      &lt;span class="icon icon-greyglobal_arrow"&gt;&lt;/span&gt; View &lt;/span&gt;
      &lt;/span&gt;
        &lt;/span&gt;
     &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;

&lt;?php } ?&gt;
</code></pre>
